Patch 4 is finally on its way to comp.sources.games.  It was
a complicated patch, and a very large one.  It may take more
time than usual for the comp.sources.games' moderator to 
re-package and script it correctly for distribution.

Due to the size of the patch, there were some changes which were
not included in it, and these will be part of Patch 5.  Among
them is the Mac port (still being refined), and (I am sorry to
disappoint many) the new "eat" timeout code.  This code exists,
but it was buggy, and it makes more sense to test it for a while
longer before inflicting it on the public.

For the development team,

-Izchak


